
# 🧠 MNIST Neural Network Classification

A simple Deep Learning project that classifies handwritten digits (0–9) using a Neural Network built with TensorFlow and Keras.

## Features
- MNIST dataset
- Data normalization
- Feedforward Neural Network
- Softmax classification
- Model evaluation
- Confusion Matrix visualization

##  Technologies
- Python
- TensorFlow / Keras
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

##  Results
- High classification accuracy on the MNIST test dataset.
- Performance evaluated using a Confusion Matrix.

## Run
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
jupyter notebook
```

